  "description": "The issues addin for Cake allows you to report issues to build servers.\n\nThis addin provides the aliases for reporting issues to build servers in Cake Frosting.\nIt requires the core Cake.Frosting.Issues addin and one or more issue provider addins for reading issues from different analyzers or linters.\n\nSee the Project Site for an overview of the whole ecosystem of addins for working with issues in Cake scripts.",
